==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkastən/|lang=de}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|kasto}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|m|Kastens|Kästen|pl2=Kasten|Kästchen|dim2=Kästlein}}

# [[crate]] (e.g. for bottles)
# {{label|de|regional|Germany}} [[box]], [[case]]
# {{label|de|regional|Austria|and|parts of|_|southern Germany}} [[cupboard]]

====Usage notes====
* The normal plural is ''Kästen''; the unchanged plural ''Kasten'' is now widely obsolete. (In the 19th century, however, the [[umlaut]] form was still deprecated as “wrong”, for example in Grimm's ''Deutsches Wörterbuch''.)

